  "rationale": "pattern_step_correspondence equates every Shared framed step from an embedding with an existential Given framed step and equality to its embedded successor. It quantifies over arbitrary states and successors and uses Unpacking.embedStatement. Both local collection and initial exit are included, as the prose explicitly requires.",
